# Pull requests

Use `gh`. Parallel first: `git status`, `git diff`, tracking vs remote, `git log` + `git diff [base]...HEAD`.

Then: branch if needed → `git push -u origin HEAD` if needed → `gh pr create` with HEREDOC body:

```text
## Summary
- …

## Test plan
- [ ] …
```

No force-push to main/master. Return the PR URL.
